{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike is the first game in a <strong><u>new</u></strong><u> <strong>subgenre</strong></u><strong> </strong>called &quot;Puzzle Combat&quot; in which, as the name implies, you defeat enemies by solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike is a very minimalistic and simple game that is hyper-focused on the idea of fast-paced puzzles. It tests your problem solving skills and ability to think quickly under pressure. Through its novel gameplay mechanics, Node Strike is able to deliver a truly unique experience unlike that of any other game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique puzzle based combat system that uses procedurally generated puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 levels split amongst 5 acts (about 2-3 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A speedrunning timer and rating system for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several secondary mechanics that introduce platforming, environmental puzzles, and other elements into the puzzle combat gameplay loop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639030?t=1759894963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639030?t=1759894963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639030/661667b94aca6c2ceb6f1252f74f670f750eea6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759894963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639030/661667b94aca6c2ceb6f1252f74f670f750eea6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759894963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3645940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike is the first game in a <strong><u>new</u></strong><u> <strong>subgenre</strong></u><strong> </strong>called &quot;Puzzle Combat&quot; in which, as the name implies, you defeat enemies by solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike is a very minimalistic and simple game that is hyper-focused on the idea of fast-paced puzzles. It tests your problem solving skills and ability to think quickly under pressure. Through its novel gameplay mechanics, Node Strike is able to deliver a truly unique experience unlike that of any other game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique puzzle based combat system that uses procedurally generated puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 levels split amongst 5 acts (about 2-3 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A speedrunning timer and rating system for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several secondary mechanics that introduce platforming, environmental puzzles, and other elements into the puzzle combat gameplay loop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DTritGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639030/aa2d6d8c7a27fdd399dea6756b77e9b40fd913d3/header.jpg?t=1759894963","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3639030/953076181/311a44c02611b79f246993710253d4f97365fba1/1759883434/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759884841","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3639030/953076181/311a44c02611b79f246993710253d4f97365fba1/1759883434/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759884841","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor